      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\(0.02\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "D",
      "text": "\\(0.2\\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "E",
      "text": "\\(2\\)"
    }
  ],
  "answer": {
    "letter": "c",
    "value": "0.02"
  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10-2001-p7.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Moving the decimal four places right multiplies \\(x\\) by \\(10000.\\) So \\(10000x=4\\cdot\\dfrac1x,\\) giving \\(x^2=\\dfrac{4}{10000}.\\)\n\nSince \\(x\\gt0,\\) \\(x=\\dfrac{2}{100}=0.02.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
